'''Maji Cat & Cat Tour Group''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was implemented in [[Version 8.4 Update|Version 8.4]] and can be unlocked when beating any stage in [[Maji Island Tour Collaboration Event#Qibao Island - With Maji Cat Stages|Qibao Island - With Maji Cat Stages]] during the [[Maji Island Tour Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 465
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Maji Cat & Cat Tour Group
|name2 = Maji Cat & Cat Tour Taiwan
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Maji Cat & Cat Tour Taiwan''' at level 10

==Strategy/Usage==
This unit's main use is to [[:Category:Cats with Weaken ability|weaken]] Red enemies which can be useful for red-pushers like [[Bore]] and [[Red Cyclone]]. However, enemies like [[Professor A.]] or enemies that outrange him can shred this cat very quickly and therefore cannot be used against. Furthermore, he is outclassed by [[Onmyoji Cat (Rare Cat)|Thaumaturge Cat]] for general usage.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller}}

